# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vercel production (required so admin changes actually persist)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option A (recommended, 1 click in Vercel):
#   Project → Storage → Create Database → Blob → Connect project
#   This auto-adds BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN. Then Redeploy.
#
# Option B (Turso / libSQL, best for concurrent bookings):
#   1. Create a free DB at https://turso.tech
#   2. Add:
#        TURSO_DATABASE_URL="libsql://your-db.turso.io"
#        TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN="..."
#   3. Redeploy (prebuild will push schema + seed when these are set)
#
# Also set:
#   AUTH_SECRET = (openssl rand -base64 32)
#   NEXTAUTH_URL = https://www.alexianailsandmore.gr
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
